OL,5,G0200 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FCanterbury to Alexandra Palace:
OL,7,     FMichael Portillo explores the east
OL,8,     Fof England in the inter-war
OL,9,     Fperiod, his journey beginning in
OL,10,     FCanterbury and ending at Alexandra
OL,11,     FPalace in London.
OL,12,G0225 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FHampstead to Islington: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo travels to Hampstead,
OL,15,     Fwhere he learns more about the
OL,16,     Ffounder of psychoanalysis, Sigmund
OL,17,     FFreud, before making his way to
OL,18,     FIslington.
